  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 375.66,
      "e": 377.66,
      "text": "She brought her other boots."
    },
    {
      "s": 377.66,
      "e": 381.66,
      "text": "I brought mine too, so I'll switch out if I have to."
    },
    {
      "s": 381.66,
      "e": 391.27,
      "text": "Are you your famous sir?"
    },
    {
      "s": 391.27,
      "e": 398.01,
      "text": "You look psyched for a shot."
    },
    {
      "s": 398.01,
      "e": 443.52,
      "text": "You look psyched."
    },
    {
      "s": 443.52,
      "e": 448.3,
      "text": "Test test."
    },
    {
      "s": 448.3,
      "e": 451.3,
      "text": "Let me start off just looking at me the whole time."
    },
    {
      "s": 451.3,
      "e": 454.3,
      "text": "Let me start off looking at your full name rank."
    },
    {
      "s": 454.3,
      "e": 459.3,
      "text": "First Sergeant Steven Staley with the 113th Engineer Battalion."
    },
    {
      "s": 459.3,
      "e": 465.79,
      "text": "He told me a little bit about the operations that have been going on this week."
    },
    {
      "s": 465.79,
      "e": 468.79,
      "text": "There's been a lot of different ones, rescue missions,"
    },
    {
      "s": 468.79,
      "e": 470.79,
      "text": "what's the flow of sandbags."
    },
    {
      "s": 470.79,
      "e": 475.79,
      "text": "Roger, doing a lot of sandbag missions here in Gary, Indiana."
    },
    {
      "s": 475.79,
      "e": 478.79,
      "text": "We moved out of Shererville and Marerville area."
    },
    {
      "s": 478.79,
      "e": 481.79,
      "text": "Also doing the about praise old report area."
    },
    {
      "s": 481.79,
      "e": 488.79,
      "text": "We pulled back from them projects for a larger project here in Gary where we're actually losing Interstate 94."
    },
    {
      "s": 488.79,
      "e": 492.79,
      "text": "And a lot of the major thoroughfarers through Gary, Indiana."
    },
    {
      "s": 492.79,
      "e": 496.79,
      "text": "So we're trying to block off the levee, the dam up the levee,"
    },
    {
      "s": 496.79,
      "e": 500.79,
      "text": "to actually stop the flow of the river."
    },
    {
      "s": 500.79,
      "e": 504.79,
      "text": "We're getting preventative and also reactive in both."
    },
    {
      "s": 504.79,
      "e": 507.79,
      "text": "The reactive is in the situation we had now with the flooding,"
    },
    {
      "s": 507.79,
      "e": 511.79,
      "text": "but preventative because we have six more inches of water flow coming this way from the west."
    },
    {
      "s": 511.79,
      "e": 516.79,
      "text": "So that looks like it could be a useless to what we're doing in some areas,"
    },
    {
      "s": 516.79,
      "e": 521.79,
      "text": "but we're preventing a tragedy from coming west here in the next few days."
    },
    {
      "s": 522.79,
      "e": 528.26,
      "text": "And what is the outlook?"
    },
    {
      "s": 528.26,
      "e": 530.26,
      "text": "It's looking good."
    },
    {
      "s": 530.26,
      "e": 534.26,
      "text": "We're out here, we have several soldiers from several units from all over Indiana"
    },
    {
      "s": 534.26,
      "e": 539.26,
      "text": "that come, they're all volunteers come in to give a helping hand."
    },
    {
      "s": 539.26,
      "e": 542.26,
      "text": "And, you know, we're facing a situation that's going to get worse,"
    },
    {
      "s": 542.26,
      "e": 544.26,
      "text": "but we believe we're on top of it."
    },
    {
      "s": 544.26,
      "e": 547.26,
      "text": "We're going to prevent from anything getting any further damage out here."
    },
    {
      "s": 549.26,
      "e": 551.26,
      "text": "Also to touch on."
    },
    {
      "s": 556.3,
      "e": 561.3,
      "text": "At least for the last 24 hours they've been running pretty crazy shifts."
    },
    {
      "s": 561.3,
      "e": 562.3,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "s": 562.3,
      "e": 566.3,
      "text": "Running around, but I mean, when you're over there watching them do the bags,"
    },
    {
      "s": 566.3,
      "e": 572.0,
      "text": "and then when they're throwing bags over here, you really enjoy morale tie."
    },
    {
      "s": 572.0,
      "e": 580.0,
      "text": "morale is very high, even though we're down to around 170 to about 170 soldiers."
    },
    {
      "s": 580.0,
      "e": 583.0,
      "text": "And we're working around the clock, working three shifts around the clock,"
    },
    {
      "s": 583.0,
      "e": 584.0,
      "text": "but morale is high."
    },
    {
      "s": 584.0,
      "e": 589.0,
      "text": "They're coming in late at night, early in the mornings, but they're all ready to get right back up,"
    },
    {
      "s": 589.0,
      "e": 592.0,
      "text": "eat breakfast, eat lunch, come right back out here and do it again."
    },
    {
      "s": 592.0,
      "e": 593.0,
      "text": "Morale is very high."
    },
    {
      "s": 593.0,
      "e": 595.0,
      "text": "And like I said, they're all volunteers."
    },
    {
      "s": 595.0,
      "e": 596.0,
      "text": "They all said yes."
    },
    {
      "s": 596.0,
      "e": 601.0,
      "text": "More in love to come out here and help Gary and the other communities out with their situation."
    },
    {
      "s": 601.0,
      "e": 603.5,
      "text": "One second."
    }
  ],
